-- allium: 4
-- The SAME naive behaviour as consumer_naive, but written WITHOUT referencing the Kafka library spec —
-- a consumer that never considered at-least-once delivery. Analysed on its own it is CLEAN: nothing in
-- its own text is violated. The latent double-processing bug is invisible until the library spec is
-- referenced (consumer_naive.allium). This is the before half of the resilience story.
component UnawareConsumer
  entity Event
  observable state applied(Event) : bool
  action apply
    ensures applied(e)
end
